  <h2>Specification</h2>
  <p>The llDamage function triggers a damage event on the targeted task. If any scripts in the target process the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/On_damage" target="_blank">on_damage</a> event, they will be fired before the damage is applied or distributed.</p>
